  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Fostering inclusivity and confronting information pollution in Chilean electoral processes</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">This project aims at developing strategies to prevent and combat misinformation in electoral contexts, and at designing and implementing actions to promote the electoral engagement of historically excluded groups. This involves specific strategies to evaluate and suggest enhancements to institutional mechanisms, with a special emphasis on women.</narrative>
  </description>
